fb_display_ja.otf, fb_body_ja.otf, fb_display_zh.otf and fb_body_zh.otf are
subsets of Noto Sans CJK JP / SC (Bold and Regular), renamed "Capy Fallback"
as the licence asks of a Modified Version.  tools/fallback_fonts.py rebuilds
them from the original collection.


